<title>UK: Mexico sets $750 million 20-year bond.</title>
<headline>Mexico sets $750 million 20-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs International and Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEXICO</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.SEP.16</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE 25/26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD   +450-462.5BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT FEB 2026 U.S. TREASURY BOND -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
